cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite both the paper and the archived repository."
title: "MMRI-ESG-Banking: reproducibility materials for benchmark-based, LLM-assisted ESG disclosure-materiality assessment"
abstract: >-
  Derived research data, model outputs, prompts and analysis code behind the
  Materiality Misalignment Risk Index (MMRI), a benchmark-based measure of the
  gap between what a bank's sustainability report discloses and what the SASB
  FN-CB Commercial Banks standard treats as material. Covers 20 sustainability
  reports from the four major Australian banks, 2021-2025, scored on six SASB
  topics across three dimensions by two language models, with weight, prompt and
  repeat-run robustness analyses and a 30-cell human validation pilot.
